<h1>1. Game Overview</h1>

<h2>1.1 Concept</h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'>Superhuman Rock Paper Sc=
issors
(SRPS) is a browser-based single-player strategy game set in 2050. Players
choose skill trees that define their competitive identity, earn powerups, a=
nd
face a living ecosystem of 99 NPC competitors across a 10-season career arc.
Visual style: SNES/16-bit retro pixel art throughout.</p>

