<h1>4. Season &amp; Tournament Structure</h1>

<h2>4.1 Season Overview</h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'>A season consists of up =
to 5
sequential tournaments of increasing size and prestige. The player advances=
 by
reaching the finals (top 2) of each tournament. Failing to reach the finals
ends the season. Winning the World Championship also ends the season. After=
 the
season ends, the player enters the off-season phase.</p>

