<h2>4.4 Jessie's Competitive Advantage</h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'>Coach Jessie Jones provi=
des the
player with two advantages that no NPC receives &#8212; grounding the
mechanical advantages in the game's narrative:</p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;
