e'>&#8226;<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
 </span></span><![endif]>Starting
15 skill points in Season 1 only &#8212; Jessie&#8217;s initial pre-season
training gives the player a one-time head start NPCs never get.</p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;
mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2'><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignor=
e'>&#8226;<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
 </span></span><![endif]>Consolation
bonus &#8212; Jessie&#8217;s off-season coaching turns a losing season into=
 a
learning opportunity. She awards the player bonus skill points (scaled by h=
ow
early the season ended) before the off-season respec. NPCs never receive th=
is
bonus.</p>

