<h2>5.5 Skill Resolution Hierarchy</h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'>When multiple skills con=
flict in
a round, resolution follows this priority order:</p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;
mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3'><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignor=
e'>1.<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></sp=
an><![endif]>Counter
skills resolve first &#8212; nullify incoming skill effects before they fir=
e.</p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;
mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3'><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignor=
e'>2.<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></sp=
an><![endif]>Legendary
powerups override everything except counters.</p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;
mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3'><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignor=
e'>3.<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></sp=
an><![endif]>Active
skills resolve next &#8212; higher tree level wins (Level 4 beats Level 2).=
</p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;
mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3'><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignor=
e'>4.<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></sp=
an><![endif]>Passive
skills apply last as modifiers.</p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;
mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3'><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignor=
e'>5.<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></sp=
an><![endif]>Ties
in precedence &#8212; defender wins (reinforcing the &quot;defense is riski=
er
but stronger&quot; philosophy).</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:5.0pt'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'>Stacking rules:</p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;
mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2'><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignor=
e'>&#8226;<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
 </span></span><![endif]>Confidence
percentages from multiple read skills cap at 95% (never certainty).</p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;
mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2'><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignor=
e'>&#8226;<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
 </span></span><![endif]>Luck-based
percentage bonuses stack additively.</p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;
mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2'><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignor=
e'>&#8226;<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
 </span></span><![endif]>Duration
effects from the same category do not stack &#8212; highest value wins.</p>

