<h2>6.5 Skill Classification System</h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'>All skills belong to nam=
ed
classifications. Counter-skills block an entire classification, not individ=
ual
skills. This makes the counter system clean and parametric.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'>Example classifications:=
 Read,
Influence, Luck, Pattern, Tie-Alteration, Counter-Read, Counter-Influence,
Counter-Luck. The full classification list &#8212; and the tag assigned to =
each
individual skill &#8212; is captured as a TBD (see Section 17, item 2).</p>

