xt'>Two
  distinct reset triggers: match start AND post-fire within same match. Two
  independent RNG rolls on fire: (1) does it fire this round? (2) is result
  false? False result chance: always flat 10% &#8212; never scales, never
  reaches 0%. Advanced NPR modifies accumulation rate only &#8212; not accu=
racy
  or false result chance. Track as running total: 10% round 1, 20% round 2,
  etc. Resets to 0% on fire or match start. Desperate Clarity boost: adds +=
20%
  to current total permanently for match remainder &#8212; does not reset o=
n NPR
  fire.</span></i></p>
