0pt;
  mso-border-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;background:cornsilk;padding:4.0pt 6.0p=
t 4.0pt 6.0pt'>
  <p class=3DMsoNormal><i><span style=3D'color:black;mso-color-alt:windowte=
xt'>NPC
  greeting rule: T1 greetings may hint at strategy/personality. T2+ greetin=
gs
  are personality-only &#8212; no clues about tree, strategy, or switch
  behavior. All tiers (including T1): no rank references, no championship
  status, no streak records, no win/loss tallies. These statements become f=
alse
  within seasons and break immersion. Personality traits (confident,
  intimidating, philosophical, friendly, trash-talking) are always fair gam=
e.
  Secondary tree must always differ from primary tree. Secondary strategy m=
ust
  always differ from primary strategy. puristRandom: re-rolls at match start
  each match (not season start). powerupStrategy is per-NPC (not per-poweru=
p):
  asap &#9474; on_loss &#9474; on_win &#9474; chance (50% hardcoded). FIFO
  inventory order always applies.</span></i></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

